    summary: "Collectives are group communication operations over a set of ranks. All-reduce sums a tensor across ranks and gives everyone the result; reduce-scatter sums and leaves each rank with one shard; all-gather concatenates shards so everyone has the whole tensor; all-to-all gives each rank a distinct piece from every other; send/recv are point-to-point. Each parallelism strategy is a choice of which of these to run where, and their cost is set by bytes, link bandwidth and the slowest participant.",
