    summary: "Data parallelism replicates about 16 bytes per parameter on every rank. ZeRO and FSDP remove that redundancy by partitioning the state across the DP ranks: stage 1 shards optimizer moments and master weights, stage 2 also shards gradients, stage 3 (FSDP full sharding) also shards the parameters themselves and all-gathers each layer's weights just before it runs. The total communication is the same as DP's all-reduce, split into a reduce-scatter and an all-gather, plus one extra all-gather for stage 3.",
    purpose: "Train models whose full state does not fit one device without introducing per-layer activation reductions, keeping the programming model of data parallelism.",
    mechanics: "Per-parameter bytes with DP degree d and mixed precision: replicated DP 16; ZeRO-1 `2 + 2 + 12 / d`; ZeRO-2 `2 + 14 / d`; ZeRO-3 `16 / d`. Stage 1 and 2: backward produces full gradients that are reduce-scattered so each rank keeps the reduced shard of the gradients for the parameters it owns; each rank runs AdamW on its shard of master weights and moments; updated parameters are all-gathered so every rank has the full BF16 working weights. Stage 3 / FSDP: parameters live sharded; before each layer's forward its parameters are all-gathered (prefetched one layer ahead to overlap), used, then freed; in backward they are all-gathered again for the local gradient computation, gradients are reduce-scattered immediately, and the unsharded copies are freed. Per-rank communication per step is about `N × bytes` (forward gather) + `N × bytes` (backward gather) + `N × bytes` (reduce-scatter) versus about `2 × N × bytes` for DP all-reduce. Sharding units are groups of layers wrapped as one flat parameter so that collectives stay large. Hybrid sharding (HSDP) shards within a node or a small group and replicates across groups, keeping all-gathers on NVLink and only gradient reductions on the network. FSDP composes with TP (shard the TP-sharded pieces further across DP) and with PP, and its checkpoints are naturally sharded. Optimizer state can also be offloaded to CPU memory at the cost of PCIe bandwidth.",
